# Scratch space for files the test suite writes at run time (e.g. save-image
# round-trip checks). Everything here is disposable and ignored; the directory
# itself is tracked via this file so tests can write into it on a fresh
# checkout without having to mkdir first.
#
# Paths are relative to lang/, which is the working directory the suite runs
# from, so tests refer to this as "tests/scratch/<name>".
*
!.gitignore
